         <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/326b525245435e15befb7f38bce37ba9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"mooyo\" data-uid=\"401342\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/mooyo\">mooyo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 03:35:11 +08:00\">22h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/agAJ0Rd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a> 不给穷鬼订阅用而已，API 是有 1M 的 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/sGyiXq9.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sGyiXq9.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068702\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b5cf19246430b8c755a033bc26689832?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"rpman\" data-uid=\"91586\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rpman\">rpman</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 03:37:27 +08:00\">22h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 默认配置文件没给你打开<br>实际上 258k 搭配 codex 也确实够用了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068708\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/068b7e99b3eade94f4599a136d0d9fc8?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"luckyjoe\" data-uid=\"631504\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/luckyjoe\">luckyjoe</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 03:50:12 +08:00\">22h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>config 里可以设置的，gpt5.6 都可以设置成 1m 了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068717\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4dfa/8c1c/38436_normal.png?m=1560377701\" alt=\"msg7086\" data-uid=\"38436\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 04:14:50 +08:00\">21h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/mooyo\">mooyo</a> Astra 一直有，5.6 的时候其实就说有了，astra 还特意在文档里写了订阅超过 272K 以后不计双倍，你走 API 是要双倍计费的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068723\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cc4f9f8eec60d58fc9e1067e022bf528?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xxx027\" data-uid=\"81757\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xxx027\">xxx027</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 05:34:24 +08:00\">20h 34m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>少点也可以，压缩做的不错。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068745\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c72a/cf0f/78954_normal.png?m=1699319258\" alt=\"wzw\" data-uid=\"78954\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wzw\">wzw</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 07:07:07 +08:00\">19h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>用 1M 会不会更不好?</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068994\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2f1a/512c/692150_normal.png?m=1768560218\" alt=\"codingerj\" data-uid=\"692150\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/codingerj\">codingerj</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 09:13:51 +08:00\">16h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没事别开 1M,要及时压缩上下文，小心你的账单</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18069493\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6ed4ee4dd2e384a9d8d47d2e7f43c5c4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"maolon\" data-uid=\"442547\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/maolon\">maolon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 10:19:51 +08:00\">15h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>他默认 258k 就是卡在分段收费之前，不然你订阅用量爆炸，本身模型支持 1M 上下文。</p><p>至于楼上说不计双倍 openai 那边只在 enterprise 计划下写不计双倍，如果有勇士想试可以试下</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18069529\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/003f1b50994eb31aeb26105920380e3a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"blackantt\" data-uid=\"215985\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 10:23:29 +08:00\">15h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/codingerj\">codingerj</a> 就是说嘛，我的 claude 20x 不够用，又买了 codex 20.  但是不知道该怎么减少初始上下文和轮数。导致一次下来，token 耗费很多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18069580\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d95f7fc49a312f6a2c2671f9a63f04ea?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zhady009\" data-uid=\"262575\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhady009\">zhady009</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 10:29:37 +08:00\">15h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>coding agent 大部分场景不需要 1m 上下文，额外的信息都是靠检索来的，1m 的边际收益通常没有想象中那么高消耗还高了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18069619\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/003f1b50994eb31aeb26105920380e3a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"blackantt\" data-uid=\"215985\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 10:34:27 +08:00\">15h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/zhady009\">zhady009</a> 那一个问题，1 轮搞不定。几轮下来，上下文越来越大。怎么解决呢？ 重开会话吧，前面杂七杂八的东西怎么跟它说呢？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18069652\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a3076ef103fff1e406e284e1255354a1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"e3c78a97e0f8\" data-uid=\"501337\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/e3c78a97e0f8\">e3c78a97e0f8</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 10:36:49 +08:00\">15h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/blackantt\">blackantt</a> 压缩呀。</p><p>实际上很多模型虽然有 1M 上下文，但是超过 200 多 k 后就变蠢，这就是为什么 Codex 把上限直接设为 258K 。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18069817\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ffca59c5ffc890b3fd7065b5f93bf4ae?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"deplives\" data-uid=\"456093\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/deplives\">deplives</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 10:56:51 +08:00\">15h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>1. codex 可以手动调整 1m 的上下文<br>2. 其实 1m 上下文到最后都是垃圾信息，opus 1m 上下文的时候，超过一半明显发现模型开始跑偏了<br>3. codex 的上下文压缩比 claude 强的不是一星半点，我用过最长的一个会话总的输入都到了 500M 了，压缩都经过几十次了，也没发现有明显的跑偏</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18069870\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e1c3b8baf61c009f01304cb23d9d60d6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"pony2335\" data-uid=\"554334\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pony2335\">pony2335</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 11:06:04 +08:00\">15h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>256k 够用了，开过 1m 和 500k ，没什么必要，除非你有长任务，可以试试水。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18070994\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/997a/6abb/210720_normal.png?m=1757041158\" alt=\"MoozLee\" data-uid=\"210720\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MoozLee\">MoozLee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 14:55:27 +08:00\">11h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>272k 后价格翻倍，舍得就改配置开启 1m</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"上下文 模型 容量31 replies • 2026-09-10 14:55:27 +08:00 1 honjow 23h 33m ago 你想开 1m 随便开啊。。 3 phrack 23h 25m ago AI 时代连文档都不读了问 AI 也行啊 4 mooyo 22h 33m ago 不给穷鬼订阅用而已，API 是有 1M 的 6 rpman 22h 31m ago codex 默认配置文件没给你打开实际上 258k 搭配 codex 也确实够用了 8 luckyjoe 22h 18m ago config 里可以设置的，gpt5.6 都可以设置成 1m 了。 9 msg7086 21h 53m ago @mooyo Astra 一直有，5.6 的时候其实就说有了，astra 还特意在文档里写了订阅超过 272K 以后不计双倍，你走 API 是要双倍计费的。 10 xxx027 20h 34m ago via Android 少点也可以，压缩做的不错。 11 wzw 19h 1m ago 用 1M 会不会更不好? 14 codingerj 16h 54m ago 没事别开 1M,要及时压缩上下文，小心你的账单 17 maolon 15h 48m ago 他默认 258k 就